 Image file (or Return to enter Xcen, Ycen directly):  Be SURE to enter CENTER coordinates, NOT NX and NY
 Xcen, Ycen:  Input model file:  Enter 0 to find transformations, 2 to find X/Y translations only,
    3 to find translations and rotations only,
    4 to find translation, rotation and mag change only,
    1 to transform model, or -1 to back-transform model:  Model built on raw sections (0) or prealigned ones(1):  Name of old file of f transforms to edit (Return if none):  Name of new file of f transforms:  Enter / to find transforms for all section pairs,
      or -999 to find transforms relative to a single section,
      or a list of the section numbers to find transforms for
         (enter number of second section of each pair, ranges are ok)
